<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
	<title>Welcome to CityCare Service</title>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 32px 16px; background-color: #f3f8f7; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #183b3a;">
	<div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #dcebe8; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden;">
		<div style="padding: 36px 40px; background-color: #0f766e; color: #ffffff;">
			<div style="margin-bottom: 24px; color: #b8eee5; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase;">CityCare</div>
			<h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.2; font-weight: 700;">Welcome aboard, <%= name %>!</h1>
		</div>
		<div style="padding: 40px;">
			<div style="width: 56px; height: 56px; margin-bottom: 24px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: #d9f5ef; color: #0f766e; font-size: 30px; line-height: 56px; text-align: center;">+</div>
			<h2 style="margin: 0 0 16px; color: #164e4b; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.3;">Your city care journey starts here.</h2>
			<p style="margin: 0 0 18px; color: #456664; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;">Hello <%= name %>, we are glad to have you with us. Your account is ready, and you can now use CityCare Service to stay connected with the care that matters to you.</p>
			<p style="margin: 0 0 28px; color: #456664; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.7;">Thank you for believing us. We are here to make every step feel simpler, fast, and more supportive.</p>
			<div style="padding: 20px 22px; background-color: #f0faf8; border-left: 4px solid #14b8a6; border-radius: 4px;">
				<p style="margin: 0; color: #245d59; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6;"><strong>A CityCare tomorrow begins with one thoughtful step today.</strong></p>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div style="padding: 24px 40px; background-color: #f8fbfb; border-top: 1px solid #e6f0ee;">
			<p style="margin: 0; color: #78918f; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6;">This is a welcome message from CityCare services. Please keep this email for your records.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</body>
</html>
